&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in immigration compliance, global mobility, or similar roles, particularly with a focus on immigration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A comprehensive understanding of immigration procedures and the typical processes involved in ensuring immigration compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced and dynamic work environment&lt;/li&gt;
