&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with Recruiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with Manager, Global Payroll Implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with Senior Director, Global Payroll Implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/Bar-Raiser-Interviews-145cb4dadab4805386fbed0892ae0f53?pvs=21&quot;&gt;Bar Raiser Interview&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/Veremark-Remote-96e108c037b8423cbd4c3f07a1f9b38b?pvs=21&quot;&gt;Prior employment verification check(s)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
